{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Where are you, Cinderella?</i></strong><i> is a visual novel about Vietnamese culture and the world of entertainment, with a fresh and modern twist on the Cinderella story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you find the lost shoe?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Tam, an actress looking for her Prince Charming, or Alberto, a famous singer searching for his Cinderella!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/5f3fd3d258982806564008ade9f21334.poster.avif?t=1771606930\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/5f3fd3d258982806564008ade9f21334.webm?t=1771606930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/5f3fd3d258982806564008ade9f21334.mp4?t=1771606930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose wisely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice impacts the storyline. Don't forget to think twice...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/13ab7cc6325c1747e7e8f4c17aa9de3f.poster.avif?t=1771606930\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/13ab7cc6325c1747e7e8f4c17aa9de3f.webm?t=1771606930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/13ab7cc6325c1747e7e8f4c17aa9de3f.mp4?t=1771606930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chat with everyone and build your career</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/21828d9f86997507d43a0c1dc7d2a455.avif?t=1771606930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Vietnamese culture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about a well-known culture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/235e81112b1a185f6e0ca4e51d671cfd.avif?t=1771606930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet your friends... Or your enemies?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have the pleasure of meeting and chatting with many curious characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/extras/9407c0ad86e3fc1626a7a750db3840bb.avif?t=1771606930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The routes are interconnected: the choices made in one protagonist's route influence the other one. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > References and explanations relating to Vietnamese culture, as well as small cultural references to other Asian countries (such as China, South Korea, and Japan) and the entertainment world, will also be included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A sweet and colourful universe awaits you.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2416930?t=1771606930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2416930?t=1771606930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i