_paragraph\" >The routes are interconnected: the choices made in one protagonist's route influence the other one. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > References and explanations relating to Vietnamese culture, as well as small cultural references to other Asian countries (such as China, South Korea, and Japan) and the entertainment world, will also be included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A sweet and colourful universe awaits you.  </p></li></ul>","developers":["KimiNako"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416930/8270125a2966f793671ca2be930e11939b9f897c/header.jpg?t=1771606930","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2416930/583198/1c2560b2cf8180b78edf8786e8ee5310b4b44146/1750916801/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765221881","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2416930/583198/1c2560b2cf8180b78edf8786e8ee5310b4b44146/1750916801/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765221881","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2416930/583198/1c2560b2cf8180b78edf8786e8ee5310b4b44146/1750916801/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765221881","id":256955861,"name":"Trailer EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256955861/00bf9d971e2b63a6e344cb3971f1c8a600ea3d3c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765221881"}],"name":"Where are you, Cinderella?","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minim